WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the Orbit Mini walkthrough. Cue text is the narration verbatim; timings
come from the measured length of each rendered line.

NOTE
Every cue carries `line:68%`. The video has its own captions burned into the bottom
edge of the frame, and the default cue position is that same bottom edge -- left alone,
the two sets of text land on top of each other. 68% seats the narration above the band
with room for a two-line cue.

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.350 line:68% align:center
Orbit Mini.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:04.826 line:68% align:center
A working slice of a client subscription dashboard.

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.328 line:68% align:center
It opens on ScaleSage's own pricing.

4
00:00:08.328 --> 00:00:10.981 line:68% align:center
Two plans, not a comparison matrix.

5
00:00:10.981 --> 00:00:15.074 line:68% align:center
Pro is marked recommended, so the choice is yes or no.

6
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.570 line:68% align:center
Signing up takes four fields.

7
00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:23.325 line:68% align:center
The password rule is stated up front, rather than revealed on failure.

8
00:00:23.325 --> 00:00:25.702 line:68% align:center
Submitting goes straight to Stripe.

9
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.341 line:68% align:center
Checkout is Stripe hosted.

10
00:00:30.341 --> 00:00:35.941 line:68% align:center
No card details ever touch this system, so there is no card data to defend.

11
00:00:35.941 --> 00:00:37.659 line:68% align:center
Note the sandbox badge.

12
00:00:37.659 --> 00:00:39.824 line:68% align:center
This is test mode throughout.

13
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:41.570 line:68% align:center
Then it waits.

14
00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:49.052 line:68% align:center
Payment succeeding and the webhook landing are different moments, so this screen polls rather than assuming.

15
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:53.180 line:68% align:center
Here is what the brief asked for.

16
00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:57.012 line:68% align:center
One page: the plan, the status, the renewal date.

17
00:00:57.012 --> 00:01:01.235 line:68% align:center
Status carries an icon and a word, never colour alone.

18
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:05.316 line:68% align:center
Plans switch either direction, prorated.

19
00:01:05.316 --> 00:01:09.798 line:68% align:center
Cancelling waits until the end of the period you already paid for.

20
00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:15.012 line:68% align:center
And it was built for a phone first, at three hundred and ninety pixels.

21
00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:22.942 line:68% align:center
A Flutter component, on a real phone, calling the same API as the web dashboard.

22
00:01:22.942 --> 00:01:25.255 line:68% align:center
Every state reviewable on its own.

23
00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:34.680 line:68% align:center
FastAPI, Postgres, Next.js, Flutter, Docker, and a Cloudflare Tunnel.

24
00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:35.473 line:68% align:center
Live now.
